                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5a18f37b-115a-3e46-96b2-8e3799a47a4b",
                        "entry_id": "5dab3d1e-7d75-3b4d-af3e-ebddf635ffa8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to be at a loss, to be bewildered, to be perplexed"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "84028fbe-f19a-4a15-9e61-16a0791fcb55",
                                "sense_id": "5a18f37b-115a-3e46-96b2-8e3799a47a4b",
                                "text": "Недоумевая́ о выска́зываниях друг дру́га, отта́лкиваясь от недоуме́ний друг дру́га, уча́стники выхо́дят за преде́лы со́бственных стереоти́пов и создаю́т внеполо́женное себе́ смыслово́е по́ле, в кото́ром то́лько и мо́жет заговори́ть текст.",
                                "translation": "Being perplexed by each other's statements and repulsed by each other's perplexities, the participants go beyond their own stereotypes and create a semantic field beyond themselves, in which only a text can speak",
                                "english": "Being perplexed by each other's statements and repulsed by each other's perplexities, the participants go beyond their own stereotypes and create a semantic field beyond themselves, in which only a text can speak"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
